  "html": "<div class=\"task choice-two question-pair\" data-choose-two=\"21\"><span data-q=\"21\" id=\"q21\"></span><span data-q=\"22\" id=\"q22\"></span><h3>Questions 21–22</h3><p class=\"instructions\">Choose <strong>TWO</strong> answers.</p><p>What are the TWO benefits of including work experience in the first year of the engineering course?</p><label><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"A\" aria-label=\"Questions 21 and 22, It encourages students to develop their sense of responsibility.\"><span>It encourages students to develop their sense of responsibility.</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"B\" aria-label=\"Questions 21 and 22, It familiarises students with engineering equipment.\"><span>It familiarises students with engineering equipment.</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"C\" aria-label=\"Questions 21 and 22, It helps students understand work-related terms.\"><span>It helps students understand work-related terms.</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"D\" aria-label=\"Questions 21 and 22, It helps students decide in which area to specialize.\"><span>It helps students decide in which area to specialize.</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"E\" aria-label=\"Questions 21 and 22, It frees students from doing work experience in the second year.\"><span>It frees students from doing work experience in the second year.</span></label></div><div class=\"task choice-two question-pair\" data-choose-two=\"23\"><span data-q=\"23\" id=\"q23\"></span><span data-q=\"24\" id=\"q24\"></span><h3>Questions 23–24</h3><p class=\"instructions\">Choose <strong>TWO</strong> answers.</p><p>Which do the students agree are the TWO best criteria for choosing a work experience placement?</p><label><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"A\" aria-label=\"Questions 23 and 24, the chance to have paid holiday\"><span>the chance to have paid holiday</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"B\" aria-label=\"Questions 23 and 24, the chance to see interaction between staff members\"><span>the chance to see interaction between staff members</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"C\" aria-label=\"Questions 23 and 24, the chance to see examples of problem-solving by management\"><span>the chance to see examples of problem-solving by management</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"D\" aria-label=\"Questions 23 and 24, the chance to participate in a range of work activities\"><span>the chance to participate in a range of work activities</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"E\" aria-label=\"Questions 23 and 24, the chance to be employed there after graduation\"><span>the chance to be employed there after graduation</span></label></div><div class=\"task note-list\"><h3>Questions 25–30</h3><p class=\"instructions\">What potential problem do the students identify for each of the following aspects of the work experience report? Choose six answers from the list and move each answer into the correct gap.</p><div class=\"match-layout\"><div><h4>Aspects of the work experience report</h4><div class=\"form-row \">the use of a computer <span class=\"me-drop sample-drop\" id=\"q25\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-q=\"25\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Question 25, choose an answer\"><span class=\"sample-number me-num\">25</span><span class=\"sample-filled\"></span></span></div><div class=\"form-row \">the photos and diagrams <span class=\"me-drop sample-drop\" id=\"q26\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-q=\"26\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Question 26, choose an answer\"><span class=\"sample-number me-num\">26</span><span class=\"sample-filled\"></span></span></div><div class=\"form-row \">the formatting of the report <span class=\"me-drop sample-drop\" id=\"q27\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-q=\"27\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Question 27, choose an answer\"><span class=\"sample-number me-num\">27</span><span class=\"sample-filled\"></span></span></div><div class=\"form-row \">the section on staffing <span class=\"me-drop sample-drop\" id=\"q28\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-q=\"28\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Question 28, choose an answer\"><span class=\"sample-number me-num\">28</span><span class=\"sample-filled\"></span></span></div><div class=\"form-row \">the section on'Company Description’ <span class=\"me-drop sample-drop\" id=\"q29\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-q=\"29\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Question 29, choose an answer\"><span class=\"sample-number me-num\">29</span><span class=\"sample-filled\"></span></span></div><div class=\"form-row \">the conclusion <span class=\"me-drop sample-drop\" id=\"q30\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-q=\"30\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Question 30, choose an answer\"><span class=\"sample-number me-num\">30</span><span class=\"sample-filled\"></span></span></div></div><div><h4>Potential problems</h4><div class=\"me-endingbank sample-bank\" data-kind=\"sections\"><button class=\"me-ending sample-token\" type=\"button\" draggable=\"false\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-value=\"A\">being too critical</button><button class=\"me-ending sample-token\" type=\"button\" draggable=\"false\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-value=\"B\">not noticing errors in language</button><button class=\"me-ending sample-token\" type=\"button\" draggable=\"false\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-value=\"C\">making it difficult for the tutor to correct</button><button class=\"me-ending sample-token\" type=\"button\" draggable=\"false\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-value=\"D\">including irrelevant material</button><button class=\"me-ending sample-token\" type=\"button\" draggable=\"false\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-value=\"E\">not relating the work experience to the course</button><button class=\"me-ending sample-token\" type=\"button\" draggable=\"false\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-value=\"F\">omitting the official recor